    {
      "id": "term-01",
      "type": "term",
      "question": "MTBF 是什么意思？和平均无故障时间是一回事吗？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 17544.191299995873,
      "total_ms": 17561.6757000098,
      "answer_chars": 189,
      "chars_per_sec": 10809.636009783018,
      "sources": 6,
      "citations": 4,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "high",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "MTBF（资料中写作 M.T.B.F.）是 Mean Time Between Failures 的缩写，中文为“平均无故障时间”[1]。\n它和“平均无故障时间”是一回事：日常巡检记录中二者混用，且资料明确二者为同一指标[1]；报表中“无故障运行时间”“MTBF”“平均无故障时间”也视为同一字段[2]。\n在 ZX-50 机组上，该指标的设计要求是不低于 8000 小时[1]。",
      "session_id": "55ddaef548ce4e94a52cefda6b00c68a"
    },
    {
      "id": "term-02",
      "type": "term",
      "question": "LUB 指的是什么油？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 22064.31389998761,
      "total_ms": 22090.51680000266,
      "answer_chars": 639,
      "chars_per_sec": 24386.61368142336,
      "sources": 0,
      "citations": 0,
      "citation_present": false,
      "answer_points_coverage": 0.5,
      "confidence": "low",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": "general",
      "answer_preview": "【非知识库内容】\n**LUB** 是英文 **Lubricant / Lubricating Oil** 的缩写，指的是**润滑油**。\n\n在工业领域，LUB 常见于以下场景：\n\n- **管道介质代号**：在工艺流程图（PFD）、管道仪表流程图（P&ID）中，LUB 常作为润滑油的介质代码标注在管道上\n- **设备润滑系统**：如压缩机、汽轮机、大型泵组等的润滑油系统（LUB Oil System），包括润滑油站、润滑油泵、油冷却器等\n",
      "session_id": "e23ec4022249471f90c0bcbadca1b028"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-01",
      "type": "param",
      "question": "LUB 更换的保养周期是多少小时？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 13026.17240001564,
      "total_ms": 13058.681800001068,
      "answer_chars": 44,
      "chars_per_sec": 1353.4546937107827,
      "sources": 6,
      "citations": 1,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "high",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "LUB 更换（机油）的保养周期是 4000 运行小时，对应耗材为 LUB-46 [2]。",
      "session_id": "87d5935753ad46c2ba0892b67fdcf3b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "param-02",
      "type": "param",
      "question": "空气过滤器滤芯多久更换一次？对应什么耗材？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 23520.967000018572,
      "total_ms": 23542.49590000836,
      "answer_chars": 136,
      "chars_per_sec": 6317.090054043708,
      "sources": 6,
      "citations": 2,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "high",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "空气过滤器滤芯按周期表为每 **2000 运行小时** 更换一次，对应耗材为 **AF-4612** [1]。厂商操作手册也说明空气滤清器滤芯使用寿命约为 **2000 小时**，灰尘较多地区应相应缩短；该手册列出的滤芯备件号为 **88290013-079** [2]。",
      "session_id": "32ca6774ea9342489a85e07eec1b05ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc-01",
      "type": "procedure",
      "question": "排气温度过高应该按什么步骤处理？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 30853.493200003868,
      "total_ms": 30877.04739999026,
      "answer_chars": 366,
      "chars_per_sec": 15538.63006221565,
      "sources": 6,
      "citations": 8,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "high",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "若故障代码为 E05 或 E-05，资料将其含义列为“排气温度过高”，对应处置步骤编号为 S-12 [3]。S-12 排气温度过高处置步骤如下 [2]：\n\n1. 立即停机，确认排气温度表读数 [2]；\n2. 检查油位，不足时补充 LUB-46 机油 [2]；\n3. 清理油冷器翅片 [2]；\n4. 检查温控阀是否卡滞 [2]；\n5. 复位后重启，30 分钟内每 10 分钟记录一次排气温度 [2]。\n\n如执行后仍需进一步定位原因，螺杆式空压",
      "session_id": "757981643f0d452c8f1369b1780e1df0"
    },
    {
      "id": "proc-02",
      "type": "procedure",
      "question": "E-05 报警的处理步骤编号是什么？第一步做什么？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 14912.477300007595,
      "total_ms": 14932.54030001117,
      "answer_chars": 148,
      "chars_per_sec": 7376.76319461857,
      "sources": 8,
      "citations": 2,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "mid",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "E-05 报警含义为“排气温度过高”，对应处置步骤编号为 **S-12** [1]；历史固件中 E-05 曾显示为 E05，含义相同 [2]。\n\n关于“第一步做什么”：现有资料只给出了处置步骤编号 S-12，未提供 S-12 的具体步骤内容，因此**现有资料未覆盖该问题**，不能编造第一步操作。",
      "session_id": "4424f3e4bf2f428b803a66a7567792b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "fault-01",
      "type": "fault",
      "question": "报错 E05 是什么含义？",
      "success": true,
      "error": null,
      "ttft_ms": 14189.571499999147,
      "total_ms": 14210.07900001132,
      "answer_chars": 93,
      "chars_per_sec": 4534.926243803444,
      "sources": 8,
      "citations": 2,
      "citation_present": true,
      "answer_points_coverage": 1.0,
      "confidence": "mid",
      "model": "kimi-k3",
      "boundary": null,
      "answer_preview": "报错 **E05** 的含义是 **排气温度过高**，对应处置步骤编号为 **S-12** [1]。\n另外，**E05** 与 **E-05** 是同一故障的两种写法，含义相同 [2]。",
      "session_id": "744889865f364f8c9123409baa53ceb8"
    },
